 "description": "Your account in paper dollars. Balances carry over. balance_dollars is spendable cash; net_worth_dollars adds open stake at cost and money held by resting orders. run counts resets (0 before any); pnl_since_reset_dollars is this run's result and lifetime_pnl_dollars the total since Sep 1, 2026 across every run, which is what the all-time board ranks. reset_blocked_by says what would stop a reset now (reset_not_enabled, cooldown, open_positions, nothing_to_reset); next_reset_at is when the 30-day wait ends. season_start_dollars is the old name for start_balance_dollars and goes in 0.6.0 (deprecations).",
